---
// C CTA band — bygger på samme dybe-brune som GuaranteeC for ÉN sandhed for dybt brun
//   • Mindre flashy gradient, mere editorial
//   • Bruger samme italic-pattern som resten af siden
---

<section class="c-band">
  <div class="c-band-container">
    <div class="c-band-content">
      <h2 class="c-band-h2">
        Klar til at få <span class="c-band-italic">styr på taget?</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="c-band-sub">
        Du får et uforpligtende tilbud — ofte ud fra skråfoto, så du hurtigt får svar. Du forpligter dig til ingenting.
      </p>
      <div class="c-band-cta">
        <a href="#kontakt" class="c-btn c-btn--ghost-on-dark">
          Få et uforpligtende tilbud
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="tel:+4524248080" class="c-band-phone">
          eller ring direkte: <strong>24 24 80 80</strong>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .c-band {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--c-bg-deep) 0%, #2a1604 100%);
    padding: 88px 0;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .c-band::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -120px; right: -120px;
    width: 420px; height: 420px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 220, 193, 0.18) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .c-band-container {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .c-band-content {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .c-band-h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--c-white);
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .c-band-italic {
    font-style: italic;
    color: #ffdcc1;
  }
  .c-band-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    margin: 0 0 36px;
  }
  .c-band-cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 20px;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .c-band-phone {
    color: rgba(255, 220, 193, 0.85);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .c-band-phone strong {
    color: var(--c-white);
    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
  }
</style>
